{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "配方法解一元二次方程：以 x²+4x+3=0 为例",
    "goals": [
      "掌握用配方法解方程 x²+4x+3=0 的完整解题步骤",
      "理解配方每一步成立的代数依据与等式性质"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "遵循学生偏好：先给出每步结论与核心式子，再解释为什么这样变形",
        "通过结构化板书对比展示移项、配方、开方与求解的逻辑链条"
      ]
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "掌握配方法解 x²+4x+3=0 的四个核心步骤及每一步成立的数学理由",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们先来看最终结论：方程 x²+4x+3=0 的两个解是 x₁=-1，x₂=-3。配方法的核心，就是把未知数集中到一个完全平方式里。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "diagram",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "过程图",
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "as": "step-01",
                    "label": "移常数项：x²+4x=-3"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "step-02",
                    "label": "两边配方：x²+4x+4=1"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "step-03",
                    "label": "完全平方：(x+2)²=1"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "step-04",
                    "label": "开方求解：x+2=±1"
                  }
                ],
                "edges": [
                  {
                    "as": "edge-01",
                    "from": "step-01",
                    "to": "step-02",
                    "label": "下一步"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "edge-02",
                    "from": "step-02",
                    "to": "step-03",
                    "label": "下一步"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "edge-03",
                    "from": "step-03",
                    "to": "step-04",
                    "label": "下一步"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x^2 + 4x + 3 = 0"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "第一步，常数项移到右边，得到 x²+4x=-3。依据是等式性质：两边同时减去 3，等式依然成立。这样左边只保留含有未知数的项。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "关注移项后的等式形式",
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "第二步是核心：两边同时加 4，得到 x²+4x+4=1。为什么加 4？因为一次项系数是 4，它的一半是 2，而 2 的平方正是 4。根据等式性质，两边同加 4，值保持相等。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x^2 + 4x + \\left(\\frac{4}{2}\\right)^2 = -3 + 4"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "第三步，左边写成完全平方形式，得到 (x+2)²=1。依据是完全平方公式 a²+2ab+b²=(a+b)²，这里 a 是 x，b 是 2。这样两个未知数项就合成了一个整块。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "(x+2)^2 = 1"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "第四步，两边直接开平方，得到 x+2=±1。因为平方等于 1 的数有 1 和 -1 两个。最后两边减 2，算得 x₁=-1，x₂=-3。每一步都有确定的代数依据，解法非常工整。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-05-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x + 2 = \\pm 1 \\implies x_1 = -1,\\; x_2 = -3"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-04-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "配方法的关键在于通过等式两边同时加上一次项系数一半的平方，将含未知数的二次与一次项转化成完全平方，进而通过直接开平方求解。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
